# 1. PROJECT IDENTITY

Project name: SettleUp

Project category: Full-stack collaborative group expense management and settlement platform.

Core purpose:

SettleUp helps friends, roommates, students, families and travelling groups record shared expenses, split costs fairly, track individual contributions, understand who owes whom, and settle their balances transparently.

It must solve real-life financial sharing problems, including situations where different people consume different items and therefore should not pay equal amounts.

It is NOT a banking application, wallet provider or payment gateway.

It should have its own recognisable visual identity, premium user experience and complete functional workflows.

